  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of space, style, and location in this immaculate 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom family home, ideally positioned in one of East Auckland’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a bright, generously proportioned layout designed for modern family life. The contemporary kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing seamlessly into open-plan living and dining areas that are perfect for everyday family life and effortless entertaining. A convenient guest toilet downstairs adds practicality for busy households and visitors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs you’ll find a private master suite along with additional well-sized bedrooms offering comfort and flexibility for growing families, home offices, or guests. Internal access garaging provides secure parking and everyday convenience, especially welcome on rainy Auckland days.\r\n\r\nThe location speaks for itself. This home is triple zoned for top-performing Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary, making it a rare find for education-focused families. You’re also within short walking distance to Half Moon Bay Marina, the ferry terminal, waterfront reserves, and popular local cafés. Highland Park shopping, Bucklands Beach, and easy motorway access to the CBD are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre in this triple-zoned pocket are rarely available. Whether you’re a family prioritising education, a professional seeking lifestyle, or an investor eyeing long-term value, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your private viewing.",
